<title>USA: Callon Petroleum CEO steps down.</title>
<headline>Callon Petroleum CEO steps down.</headline>
<dateline>NATCHEZ, Miss. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Callon Petroleum Co said on Thursday John Callon, 76, resigned as chief executive officer and will be replaced by Fred Callon, 46, its president and chief operating officer, as its new chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The firm said Fred Callon is John Callon's nephew.</p>
<p>Senior vice president Dennis Christian, 50, assumed the position of chief operating officer, Callon said.</p>
<p>John Callon will continue to serve as chairman of the board and as a special consultant to the company.</p>
</text>
